From c66d0651fa6d27e31645fe9c930ed2500a4181f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard DEMONGEOT <richard@rdem-systems.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:32:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 103/120] ci: actions on Node.js 24

GitHub forces the Node.js 20 actions onto Node.js 24 and warns on every
run. Each moves to its first major that runs on Node.js 24:
checkout v5, setup-go v6, setup-node v5, upload-artifact v6,
download-artifact v7, cache v5, azure/login v3. The only breaking change
on the way (download-artifact v5: the path of a single artifact
downloaded by ID) does not apply: the release job downloads every
artifact by path.
